diff --git a/docs/source/user_guide/building_doc/building_fabric.md b/docs/source/user_guide/building_doc/building_fabric.md
index f24ce95..033d269 100644
--- a/docs/source/user_guide/building_doc/building_fabric.md
+++ b/docs/source/user_guide/building_doc/building_fabric.md
@@ -20,6 +20,13 @@ FABulous create-project demo
 
 This will create a new project named `demo` in the current directory.
 
+New projects include an `E_term` east-boundary routing tile under
+`Tile/E_term` and register it in `fabric.csv`. To use it, place `E_term` in
+the east-edge cell of each applicable interior row. Its W1, W2, WW4, and W6
+routing channels must match the neighboring core tile. The default example
+fabric keeps its existing `RAM_IO` east edge, so creating a project does not
+change the example layout automatically.
+
 (fabulous-directory)=
 ### The .FABulous directory
 
